on.",score:"6.8",tag:qb.couple})],[pb.CAR_CLEANLINESS]:[Hb({author:"Mia",datetime:"8 September 2024",positive:"Car interior was spotless and smelled fresh.",negative:"Exterior had a few muddy marks from the previous driver.",score:"9.0",tag:qb.couple}),Hb({author:"Noah",datetime:"30 August 2024",positive:"Very clean cabin and wiped-down surfaces throughout.",negative:"",score:"9.3",tag:qb.family})],[pb.DESK_LOCATION]:[Hb({author:"Ella",datetime:"7 September 2024",positive:"Desk was easy to find just outside arrivals.",negative:"Signage inside the terminal could be improved.",score:"8.2",tag:qb.soloPersonal}),Hb({author:"Chris",datetime:"28 August 2024",positive:"Counter location was convenient next to the car park shuttle.",negative:"A long walk from the terminal with heavy luggage.",score:"7.4",tag:qb.groupPersonal})],[pb.EXPECTED_CAR]:[Hb({author:"Priya",datetime:"4 September 2024",positive:"Received the exact model we booked online.",negative:"",score:"9.2",tag:qb.couple}),Hb({author:"Tom",datetime:"22 August 2024",positive:"Upgrade was a pleasant surprise.",negative:"Got a smaller car than the category shown at booking.",score:"5.8",tag:qb.soloBusiness})],[pb.PICK_UP_SPEED]:[Hb({author:"Liam",datetime:"3 September 2024",positive:"Keys were ready and we were on the road in under 10 minutes.",negative:"",score:"9.4",tag:qb.couple}),Hb({author:"Aisha",datetime:"20 August 2024",positive:"Quick handover once paperwork was complete.",negative:"Waited 40 minutes because the car was not ready.",score:"6.1",tag:qb.family})],[pb.DROP_OFF_SPEED]:[Hb({author:"Oliver",datetime:"9 September 2024",positive:"Drop-off inspection was fast and hassle-free.",negative:"",score:"9.0",tag:qb.soloPersonal}),Hb({author:"Grace",datetime:"18 August 2024",positive:"Staff processed return quickly at the desk.",negative:"Queue for returns stretched around the building.",score:"6.9",tag:qb.couple})],[pb.CAR_CONDITION]:[Hb({author:"Ethan",datetime:"6 September 2024",positive:"Car drove smoothl